   "requirement_id": "R5.3.0(2)",
   "requirement_text": "A clinician-requested bolus shall be delivered at the rate, Fccb, of VTBI divided by the duration chosen by the clinician, ∆ccb, in addition to the prescribed basal flow rate, Fbasal, but no more than the maximum flow rate for the pump, Fmax. Fccb = min(VTBI/∆ccb + Fbasal, Fmax)"
